title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/metarecord-list:clear
catalog: GUI command
target: metarecord-list:clear
summary: Metarecord list: clear a zone

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``metarecord-list`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``p shift+e`` → ``metarecord-list:clear simplified`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
* ``p shift+q`` → ``metarecord-list:clear normal`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
* ``p u`` → ``metarecord-list:clear all`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
* ``shift+f`` → ``metarecord-list:clear finder`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
